{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33932","headline":"暇日独处寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"暇日独处寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽慵不觉耗年光，犀柄金徽乱一牀。\n野客共爲赊酒计，家人同作借书忙。\n园蔬预遣分僧料，廪粟先教算鹤粮。\n无限高情好风月，不妨犹得事吾王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}